  "title": "RYANAIR WINS IRISH HIGH COURT RULING AGAINST EDREAMS",
  "summary": "HIGH COURT REJECTS EDREAMS’ ATTEMPT TO AVOID IRISH COURTS Ryanair, Europe’s No.1 airline, today (22 Jul) welcomed a High Court ruling rejecting Edreams’ challenge to the Irish courts’ jurisdiction, which now allows Ryanair’s case, to stop Edreams screenscraping Ryanair.com and overcharging customers, to proceed. The victory follows an earlier High Court order under which Edreams gave a permanent undertaking not to access Ryanair’s Travel Agent Direct (“TAD”) platform, after Ryanair uncovered Edreams unauthorised use of […]",
